  "details": "A bug related to generic avatars. It seems that generic avatars despite stating on the website to be able to use Base, Action, and FX layers do not currently. It's only effected by whatever animator you put onto the avatar's Animator property.\n\nAs well there seems to be a bug for animations on a second layer within the animator. On a secondary layer I made an animation that then goes to a second animation and despite that being all it is able to do I found that it kept going back to the initial state without anything directing back to it.",
